      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a crisis response plan for our leadership team. We're seeing a lot of heat on social media because we haven't taken a public stance on the new [Environmental/Social Reform] legislation that's being debated right now. Some of our target users are calling us out for staying silent.\n\nShould we issue a formal statement supporting the legislation to align with our core demographic, or is it better to remain neutral to avoid a backlash from the other side? Can you give me the pros and cons for both approaches?",
