      "content": "Issuing a formal statement risks reinforcing your target demographic but may alienate portions of your audience who oppose the reform, potentially fragmenting unity. Remaining neutral preserves broader relationships and avoids immediate intense backlash, yet it could be interpreted as silence that fuels criticism from users expecting more action. Ultimately, the decision hinges on whether your current social pressure points more toward the affected group or the opposition and what your brand's long-term positioning requires.",
